  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>Block Overlay Fix</strong> 是一款客户端模组，用于修复站在不会造成窒息（主要是楼梯、台阶以及开启“快速图形”时的树叶）的方块内时出现的透视（X-Ray）问题。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>运行此模组需要安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mixinbootstrap\" rel=\"nofollow\">MixinBootstrap</a>！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mixin-0-7-0-8-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mixin 0.7-0.8 Compatibility</a> 在其它模组使用了旧版 Mixin 导致游戏无法启动时可能会有所帮助。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/YXgPJnJafP\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-5865F2?logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"139\" height=\"40\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmeldexun\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--fi-F06060?logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"40\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/meldexun\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Patreon-FFC34C?logo=patreon&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"40\"></a></p>",
